---
title: Mashed Potatoes
image: https://www.wellplated.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Easy-Garlic-Mashed-Potatoes.jpg
time required: 30 minutes
servings: 7
---

Add @potatoes{3.5%lbs}(rinsed, scrubbed, quartered) to a #stockpot and cover with @water{} so there's 2-inches of water above them.

Boil on high for at most ~{20%minutes}, until a fork easily goes through them.

Strain and move into a mixing bowl. With a #potato masher{}, break up the large chunks.

Move to a #stand mixer{} and mix with @butter{2%sticks}(room temperature, cubed), @?onion powder{}, @?garlic powder{}, @?salt{}, @?pepper{}, @?chili powder{}, @?shredded cheese{}, and @milk{1/8%cup} until the desired consistency is reached.